cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Signal Colocalization Analysis Workflow — an ELN-integrated, cloud-run pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A self-service signal-colocalization workflow wired into an electronic lab
  notebook (ELN). Scientists upload microscopy images through a web form; the
  platform segments a reference cell population with Cellpose and measures
  signal-channel colocalization (Manders, Pearson, Jaccard, positive fraction)
  per cell and per image on cloud GPU, writing auditable results back to the
  originating experiment.
